OL,3,GNEWSACar that crashed into house was in
OL,4,Apolice chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car that smashed into the front room
OL,7,Fof a house and ended up on its roof was
OL,8,Fbeing chased by police before it
OL,9,Fcrashed.
OL,11,FNorth Wales Police said the vehicle had
OL,12,Ffailed to stop for officers, entered a
OL,13,Froad closure, collided with a bridge
OL,14,Fand hit the property on Canal View,
OL,15,FChirk Bank, Shropshire, at about 21:54
OL,16,FGMT on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
