OL,3,GNEWSACar that crashed into house was in
OL,4,Apolice chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service was
OL,7,Fcalled to the scene just after 22:00,
OL,8,Fand said a man, who was driving the
OL,9,Fcar, suffered potentially serious
OL,10,Finjuries, and was taken to the Riyal
OL,11,FShrewsbury Hospital.
OL,13,FNobody was in the room at the time of
OL,14,Fthe crash, Shropshire Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService added.
